This is an electric popcorn maker for household use. Electrothermic appliances of a domestic type fall in heading 8516. Subheading 8516.60 covers other ovens, cookers, cooking plates, boiling rings, grillers and roasters. Popcorn makers have been classified in CBP rulings under 8516.60.80 (other) or 8516.60.40 (cooking stoves, ranges and ovens). The CBP ruling for the Dash popcorn maker appears to place it in 8516.60.8090.

Within 8516.60.80, the statistical suffix is 90 for other. I'm going from memory of the rulings and have not checked the current schedule.

{"hts_code": "8516.60.8090", "reason": "A household electrothermic popcorn maker with a heating plate is a domestic electrothermic cooking appliance of heading 8516, falling in the residual 'other' provision of subheading 8516.60.80."}
